  "description": "Macchiato – Precision Performance for Speed and Adventure\nThe Macchiato Tandem is perfectly suited for riders who crave speed, precision, and adventure. Whether you're challenging friends at the next tandem rally or cruising down the coast on Highway 101 for a weeklong tour looking for lighthouses, the Macchiato delivers lightweight performance, strength, and superior control. Built with 7005 tandem-specific aluminum tubing and the Co-Motion T390 carbon fork, this tandem combines the best of both materials for a responsive, comfortable ride. Handcrafted with our signature artisan's touch, the Macchiato is a top-tier tandem for those who demand the best.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 700c wheels with 28-32mm tires for a smooth, fast ride\n\nExclusive ACMUltra7 7005 aluminum zonally-butted tandem tubing for strength and low weight\n\nTapered head tube & matching Co-Motion carbon T390 fork for precision control and stability\n\nRack and fender mounts for touring convenience and utility\n\nDual disc brakes for powerful stopping power in all conditions\n\nShimano Ultegra drivetrain for smooth, responsive shifting\n\nGates Carbon Drive timing belt for a smooth, low-maintenance ride\n\nRolf Prima tandem disc wheelset for durability and high performance\n\nInternal Di2 wiring & hydro brake mounts for a clean, modern setup\n\nChoose from Shimano mechanical, Di2 electronic, or SRAM AXS for your preferred shifting system, and make your Macchiato Tandem race-ready with our performance options. This tandem is designed for riders who want the best in speed, versatility, and adventure, with a lightweight build and top-of-the-line components.\n\nComplete bike starting at $10,195.00\nConfigure custom features and price options below\n\nClick here to get your Co-Motion\nMacchiato order started!",
